<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57918" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῑμᾰκ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῖμαξ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>small ladder</i> or <i>stair</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.97.5
			</span></i> (pl.); <i>ship's ladder,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.1622.149
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				203
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				272
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>woman who makes a stepladder of herself</i>, by letting persons
			step on her back to mount a carriage, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.50d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				6.256d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>wooden groove</i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διώστρα</span>
			in a torsion-engine, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				54.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				100.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>surgical machine</i> for reducing dislocations, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				47.4.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> wooden
				<i>frame</i> with openings for coffers in ceilings, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.372
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				373
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Delos</u>
				504
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
